---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const pageTitle = "About Us - Online Overtime Calculator";
const pageDescription = "Learn why we built Online Overtime Calculator. A fast, free, 100% private overtime calculator built specifically to handle FLSA and complex 50-state daily and weekly labor laws.";
const pageKeywords = "about online overtime calculator, free overtime calculator, flsa overtime calculation, 50 states overtime rules 2026";
---

<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  keywords={pageKeywords}
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="section-container pt-8 sm:pt-12 pb-6 text-center">
      <p class="mono-eyebrow mb-2">OUR PURPOSE • BUILT FOR WORKERS & EMPLOYERS</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">About Online Overtime Calculator</h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
        We built the tool we wish existed: a lightning-fast, privacy-respecting overtime calculator that accurately accounts for every state's unique labor laws.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="section-container pb-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
        
        <!-- Story Card -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold mb-4" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">The Problem with Generic Overtime Calculators</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Most overtime calculators on the web treat overtime as a trivial equation: <span class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">Hours > 40 × 1.5</span>. While that reflects basic federal FLSA standards, it fails millions of American workers and small businesses located in states with daily overtime laws.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            For example, in California, you earn overtime after 8 hours in a single workday and double time after 12 hours (as well as 8 hours on the 7th consecutive day). In Colorado, overtime triggers after 12 hours in a workday or 12 consecutive hours. In Alaska and Nevada, daily limits also apply. Using a generic calculator in these states can leave hundreds or thousands of earned dollars unaccounted for.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Four Pillars Section -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold mb-6" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Our Core Principles</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            
            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-hairline);">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
                  <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-1" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">100% Client-Side Privacy</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                Your pay is confidential. All calculations happen inside your browser memory. We never store, transmit, or monetize your hourly rates or work schedule.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-hairline);">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                  <polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-1" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">All 50 U.S. States</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                Whether you live in California with daily and double-time rules or Texas with standard weekly FLSA rules, each state is calibrated with verified 2026 regulations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-hairline);">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
                  <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/>
                  <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-1" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Visual Pay Breakdown</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                See exactly where your money comes from with color-coded breakdowns: straight pay, time-and-a-half (1.5×), and double-time (2.0×) premium pay.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-hairline);">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
                  <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-1" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Zero Paywalls or Popups</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                No mandatory email sign-ups, subscriptions, or intrusive popups. Open the calculator, input your hours, and get results instantly.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Who We Serve -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Who Uses Our Calculator?</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--color-g-link);"></span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-sm block" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Hourly Employees & Shift Workers</strong>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                  Verify paystubs for accuracy after working long shifts, double shifts, or 6-to-7-day consecutive workweeks.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--color-g-link);"></span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-sm block" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Small Business Owners & Managers</strong>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                  Quickly estimate labor costs when scheduling overtime or planning project budgets without firing up complex payroll software.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="p-4 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
              <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0" style="background-color: var(--color-g-link);"></span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-sm block" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Payroll & Human Resources Specialists</strong>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
                  Perform quick secondary sanity checks across multiple jurisdictions to verify overtime compliance.
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA Box -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl text-center space-y-4" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Ready to Calculate Your Overtime Pay?</h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            Choose your state or use federal FLSA rules to see your gross pay breakdown in seconds.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="/OvertimeCalculator/select-state/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-all shadow-sm" style="background-color: var(--color-g-ink); color: var(--color-g-on-primary);">
              Launch Overtime Calculator →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Section -->
        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--color-g-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-g-hairline);">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-g-ink);">Feedback & Questions</h2>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: var(--color-g-body);">
            We are dedicated to maintaining the most accurate wage calculator on the web. If you notice a recent legislative update or have an idea to make this tool better, we'd love to hear from you:
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xs mono-eyebrow">Email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:hello@onlineovertimecalculator.com" class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-medium underline" style="color: var(--color-g-link);">
              hello@onlineovertimecalculator.com
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
